                mighty herb of Allvis the dwarf and I shall help you. Teleri, one
                of my pupils, will lend you his aid.~";
            } else if(Herb in player) {
                remove Herb;
                score = score + 10;
                "^A mighty voice says ~Thank you, my friend~. The herb dissolves
                into smoke. ~If you say 'algeothel' anywhere in the ravine a
                secret way will open. You may pass through the eastern gate~. The
                voice echoes away through the hall.";
